01:04:40,000 --> 01:04:46,000
Dalíland is a 2022 American biographical film directed by Mary Harron.

11
01:11:08,000 --> 01:11:14,000
It is based on the true story of the painter Salvador Dalí and his
tempestuous marriage to muse and wife Gala during the 1970s.

12
01:17:36,000 --> 01:17:42,000
The film stars Ben Kingsley, Barbara Sukowa, Christopher Briney, Rupert Graves,
Alexander Beyer, Andreja Pejić, Suki Waterhouse, and Ezra Miller.

13
01:24:04,000 --> 01:24:10,000
Dalíland had its world premiere at the Toronto International Film Festival on September 17,
2022 and was released in the United States on June 9, 2023 by Magnolia Pictures.

14
01:30:32,000 --> 01:30:38,000
The tone is emotional.
